<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Maseca cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Maseca cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said on Thursday it had downgraded its rating for Mexico's Grupo Industrial Maseca SA de CV to long-term accumulate from buy and to near-term neutral from accumulate.</p>
<p>-- American Depositary Receipts in the company closed on Wednesday at 16.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
